{'symbol': 'MMC', 'date': '2023-06-12 08:37:00', 'title': 'HAFIZE GAYE ERKAN RESIGNS FROM MARSH MCLENNAN BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MARSH MCLENNAN (NYSE: MMC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT, DUE TO HER RECENT APPOINTMENT AS GOVERNOR OF TÜRKIYE'S CENTRAL BANK, HAFIZE GAYE ERKAN HAS STEPPED DOWN AS A MEMBER OF ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. AS A MEMBER SINCE EARLY 2022, MS. ERKAN SERVED ON THE AUDIT AND DIRECTORS AND GOVERNANCE COMMITTEES DURING HER TIME ON THE BOARD. “WE WOULD LIKE TO THANK GAYE FOR HER SERVICE AT MARSH MCLENNAN AND RECOGNIZE THE CONTRIBUTIONS OF HER INSIGHTS AND OPERATIONAL."}